<title>LATVIA: BOURSE THREATENS SMALLER STOCKS WITH SUSPENSION.</title>
<headline>BOURSE THREATENS SMALLER STOCKS WITH SUSPENSION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riga stock exchange on Thursaday said it will suspend quoting five smaller secondary list stocks next week if they fail to provide mandatory financial information by May 25.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that it will stop quoting Akta, Liepaja and Ventspils fish canneries, Naruta confectionery and Rota1 from next Monday, May 26.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
